# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local Deno KV (SQLite-backed) — `deno task dev` / test scratch DBs
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
kv.sqlite3*

# Secrets / local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Every other dot-directory is local tooling (.claude/, .codex/, …) and is not
# part of the published repo. `.github` must be re-included explicitly or the
# workflows silently never reach GitHub — git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so this negation has to name the directory.
.*/
!.github

# Local scratch server (hardcodes absolute paths)
_smoke.ts

# NOTE: s.js is build output but IS committed on purpose — Deno Deploy runs the
# repo with no build step, so the beacon must be in the tree. Rebuild with
# `deno task build-client` and commit the result.
